.* DEVICESTS: the task menu for device status.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='DEVICESTS'.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKDEVD PNLGRP=QHCFCMD.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.F1=Help
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION='CMD CALL QCMD'.F9=Command line
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DEVICESTS HELP=HLPDEVICESTS KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Device Status Tasks
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.To select one of the following, type its number below and press Enter:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD WRKDEVD DEVD(*DSP)' HELP=WRKDEVD.Work with display devices
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD WRKDEVD DEVD(*PRT)' HELP=WRKDEVD.Work with printer devices
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD WRKDEVD DEVD(*TAP)' HELP=WRKDEVD.Work with tape devices
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD WRKDEVD DEVD(*DKT)' HELP=WRKDEVD.Work with diskette devices
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='CMD ?PRTDEVADR' HELP='DEVICESTS/OPT10'.Print local device addresses
:EMENU.
:BOTINST.Type a menu option below
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPDEVICESTS.Device Status Tasks - Help
:P.Each option lists the devices of one kind with their state, so they can
be varied on or off.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter. F9 opens a command line, F3
leaves the menu and F12 returns to the one before it.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F1=Help
:PD.Shows help for where the cursor is.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F9=Command line
:PD.Shows a command line to run a command from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DEVICESTS/OPT10'.Print local device addresses
:P.Option 10. Runs the PRTDEVADR command&colon. Print local device
addresses.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
